         <div type="commentary" subtype="linebyline">
            <list>
               <item corresp="#lb4" xml:space="preserve"><ref>4</ref> <p>The name Πατμών, -οντος (TM Nam #11342) has otherwise remained unattested and should be considered a ghostname. The father's name in l. 4 is rather a form of Πατκόννις, which is so far attested only at Karanis: <ref target="http://www.trismegistos.org/name/11336">TM Nam #11336</ref>. </p></item>
            </list>
